{{Quote|You sent a holo of a female Crolute. No such thing. Crolutes are exclusively male. The Gilliands on my planet&mdash;they're the female ones. Shoulda tried one of them.|[[Unkar Plutt]], to [[Scoggan]] and [[Davjan Igo]]|<ref name="True Love" />}}
The '''Gilliands''' were one of the two [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that lived on the [[ocean]]ic [[planet]] of [[Crul]]. They were exclusively [[Gender|female]], while the other species, the [[Crolute]]s, were exclusively male.<ref name="True Love" /> [[Z'Vk'Thkrkza]] was a Gilliand who ran a [[Aunt Z's Tavern|tavern]] on the ''[[Colossus]]'', located on the [[planet]] [[Castilon]].<ref name="Resistance" />

